<title>GERMANY: D.Telekom limits chance of new share issue.</title>
<headline>D.Telekom limits chance of new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German telecommunications giant Deutsche Telekom would list more shares only to finance large investments in other enterprises, chief finance officer Joachim Kroeske said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We would need a second tranche only if we faced significant domestic or foreign investments,&quot; Kroeske said.</p>
</text>
